      "text": "Heat canola oil in a heavy skillet over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook garlic cloves in hot oil, turning once, until brown on both sides, 4 to 5 minutes. Smash garlic cloves in the skillet with a fork.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CxVZiVAJFO8tfsxYmf2Z5Mc5r3Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220642-quick-and-easy-refried-beans-ddmfs-step-02-3x4-0901-2e61aac93d424f679d80d043702778a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220642/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir pinto beans, cumin, chili powder, and salt into mashed garlic and cook until beans are thoroughly heated, about 5 minutes. Stir occasionally.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wwdx_WjmhzC0_FVB4qKbPqs8oYc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220642-quick-and-easy-refried-beans-ddmfs-step-03-3x4-0902-9aa567d77c934caca6d210875b5a6cc5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/220642/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Smash bean mixture with a potato masher to desired texture. Squeeze lime juice over smashed beans and stir until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VstFb9L-SdhuLcPuK0iyNNbTzrQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/220642-quick-and-easy-refried-beans-ddmfs-step-04-3x4-0909-2183497a7a0441749c1909e61b84bed3.jpg"
